    "text": "A 22-year-old man was arrested early this week after allegedly checking car doors in a public parking lot and later linked to another recent theft in the city.\nOfficers with the San Luis Police Department responded to a call about a suspicious person in the 800 block of William Brooks Avenue, where a man was reportedly walking through a parking lot testing whether vehicles were locked.",
